{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4549","id":4734594255,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU59Ms88AAAABGjQszw","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4549","diff_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4549.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pull/4549.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/issues/4549","number":4549,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"SF-A29-T05.6: validate LSP request parameters and method names","user":{"login":"wieslawsoltes","id":2297442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTc0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2297442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Task: SF-A29-T05.6\nRelated: #1148\n\n## Problem and behavior\n\nMalformed LSP parameter containers could expose incidental JavaScript errors, and missing or invalid method names were treated as unknown methods or notifications. These outcomes made the protocol fuzz oracle observe implementation failures rather than deliberate protocol validation.\n\nThe server now validates consumed parameter containers before dispatch and returns stable -32602 messages for invalid params, textDocument containers, and document URIs. Missing, empty, or non-string methods return -32600 Invalid Request, preserving a usable request ID and using null otherwise. Valid notifications remain response-free; lifecycle errors and existing unknown-method behavior remain intact.\n\nThe fuzz oracle recognizes only the exact repaired LSP diagnostics. Arbitrary native errors still count as findings. DAP behavior is unchanged.\n\n## Structure and scope\n\nThe existing semantic-token encoder is extracted without changing its algorithm so the frozen LSP implementation shrinks. The new public regression file is registered in the A21 manifest. There are no new dependencies.\n\n### Changes outside this workstream\n\nThis minimal protocol-package correction is required by A29 malformed-request qualification. The live A21 claims were checked before editing and no matching reservation was found. The active DAP error-body reservation is respected. This is a container and method-boundary correction, not complete validation of every nested method parameter.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Parent source bf85020e6024cdd679a0234d9f050ca7dedddf53 with the added public regressions: 32 tests, 21 pass, 11 fail.\n- Final source: 60 tests pass; zero failures, skips, or cancellations.\n- Command: `node scripts/limited.js node --test --test-concurrency=1 --test-reporter=tap tests/a21-lsp-parameters.test.js tests/protocol-lsp-envelope.test.js tests/protocol.test.js tests/conformance/fuzz/protocol-sequences.test.js`.\n- Independent source review found no blocking issue.\n- Tested local commit: 9b68871739384e0f56bda8f627ea485bd0fc89e1.\n- Tested and published tree: e579cc636bacd0fdcf349766bb33d522425a5d0c. Publication preserves that exact tree; commit metadata differs.\n\nTests ran serially on Linux with Node 24.19.0. Ordinary core does not run the unit suite. Full multi-platform qualification is staged for the completed scope, and #1148 remains open for its remaining acceptance requirements.","created_at":"2026-10-04T13:07:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T13:08:11Z","closed_at":"2026-10-04T13:08:10Z","merged_at":"2026-10-04T13:08:10Z","merge_commit_sha":"8df7304f3895d721c8fe95923fb3d349646d0d6c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":12526353617,"node_id":"LA_kwDOU59Ms88AAAAC6qD80Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/labels/size/L","name":"size/L","color":"A14C05","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4549/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/4549/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/issues/4549/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wieslawsoltes/SharpForge/statuses/0179c25b37ea1701e1c99e32799975aecfea9f5b","head":{"label":"wieslawsoltes:codex/p4-lsp-params","ref":"codex/p4-lsp-params","sha":"0179c25b37ea1701e1c99e32799975aecfea9f5b","user":{"login":"wieslawsoltes","id":2297442,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTc0NDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2297442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes","html_url":"https://github.com/wieslawsoltes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wieslawsoltes/repos","events_url":"https://ap